{ "name": "letlois-onboarding-guide", "compatibility_date": "2026-08-28", "assets": { "directory": "./dist", "not_found_handling": "single-page-application" } } The "single-page-application" setting matters here — without it, navigating straight to a URL like onboarding.letlois.com/ads/a2p (rather than clicking there from the homepage) would 404, since the server has no idea that route exists until the React app's own router loads.
